* Datasheet-fitted 25 C approximations; not manufacturer-supplied SPICE models.
* Littelfuse SMCJ40A: BV midpoint 46.75 V at 1 mA;
* Rs fitted to 64.5 V at 23.3 A. Cjo is assumed; pulse heating not modeled.
.model SMCJ40A D(Is=10n N=1.2 Rs=0.75 Bv=46.75 Ibv=1m Cjo=500p Vj=0.7 M=0.4)
* STPS2H100A: fit conservative 25 C maximum Vf points 0.79 V / 2 A
* and 0.88 V / 4 A. Reverse capacitance is approximate. No thermal model.
.model STPS2H100A D(Is=1.8e-10 N=1.2 Rs=0.034 Bv=100 Ibv=1u Cjo=150p Vj=0.7 M=0.5 Eg=0.69)
